  "body": "/api/analyze currently does await file.read() (see main.py),\nbuffering the entire upload into memory, risking OOM with large evidence files. Fix by streaming the upload to a secure temp file in chunks, updating SHA256 and MD5 incrementally, aborting if cumulative size > MAX_FILE_SIZE, and ensuring temp-file cleanup and non-blocking IO. Add tests for large-file upload (no OOM), hash correctness, and overflow rejection.\n\n@Akshay473 could you look at this issue and assign it to me under gssoc",
